\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Equal arcs recover the preserved shape}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{Suppose #{|S|=N\ge 3} and every arc equals #{1/N}. The
[cyclic arc precision](fdip-00B6) is then a
[uniform cycle precision](fdip-00AW). The diagonal value is
#{2m\coth(m/N)} and the neighbor value is
#{\frac{m}{\sinh(m/N)}}. The [shape](fdip-00AW) is
#{\coth(m/N)\sinh(m/N)=\cosh(m/N)}.
This is the family in \ref{fdip-00AY} with constant #{\kappa=1}.
The neighbor value is the prefactor in that family.}
